        "created_at": "2014-02-12T16:50:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Silverleaf\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/silverleaf/48/2332_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Silverleaf:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Apart from when he's wrong.&nbsp;</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I'm only wrong when I need to show evidence that I am human. I can't have people start suspecting things… Err… I mean… Ignore me!</p>",
