      {
        "id": 90951,
        "name": "Envisioner",
        "username": "Envisioner",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/9de053/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-02-12T23:37:13.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Ronway\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/48/1856_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Ronway:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I don't pick on people who make absoluts, I point out their errors so that way they can better themselves from it. Will they make the same statement now that I had let them know? I would hope not.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Nobody likes to be nagged.&nbsp; Sometimes it's better to let people have their little misconceptions.</p>",
